ith clear role badges (`admin`, `officer_zou`, `officer`, `verifier`).\n+\n \n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown."}
{"step_index":278,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:23:24Z","content":"The CSS styling for all textboxes and forms has been redesigned and modernized.\n\n### Key Styling Enhancements Applied\n\n1. **Full-Width & Symmetric Alignment**:\n   - Fixed the issue where textboxes were truncated midway across the card. `.input-control` is now explicitly set to `width: 100% !important` with a standard 48px height and 12px rounded corners.\n   - Textboxes now seamlessly align with the full width of the submit button and form card.\n\n2. **Contrast & Clean Backgrounds**:\n   - Replaced the dull grey/light-blue background tints with a crisp, pure white (`#ffffff`) input background.\n   - Replaced harsh focus outlines with a clean 1.5px slate border (`#cbd5e1`) and a soft, modern focus glow (`0 0 0 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12)`).\n   - Added browser `-webkit-autofill` fixes so saved credentials in Chrome/Edge render cleanly without the browser's default harsh blue/yellow tint.\n\n3. **Input Icons & Password Visibility Toggle**:\n   - Added SVG icons inside textboxes (User icon 👤 for username, Lock icon 🔒 for password).\n   - Added an interactive **Show/Hide Password** toggle button (`👁️` / `🙈`) to inspect entered passwords easily.\n\n4. **Card & Button Presentation**:\n   - Styled the form container into a modern `.auth-card` with an icon badge header (`🎓`), refined typography, and soft depth shadows.\n   - Elevated the primary button with a smooth gradient, hover lift (`transform: translateY(-1px)`), and active states.\n   - Re-styled the Quick Demo Accounts section with color-coded role tags (`admin`, `officer_zou`, `officer`, `verifier`) and one-click auto-fill.\n\n5. **Cross-Portal Consistency**:\n   - Applied these textbox and form presentation styles across the entire application, including the **Verification Console search box** and the **Issue New Academic Credential** form on the Dashboard.\n\nYou can launch and view the refreshed interface by running `.\\run-app.bat` and navigating to `http://localhost:8080/login`."}
