{"step_index":319,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:37:35Z","content":"The application has been packaged and is actively running on `http://localhost:8080`.\n\n### Summary of Changes Deployed\n\n1. **Zimbabwe State University Database Population (83 Records Total)**:\n   - Seeded **8 major Zimbabwean State Universities** with **10 distinct students and degree programs each** (80 new records + 3 baseline records):\n     - **University of Zimbabwe (UZ)**: BSc Computer Science, MBChB Medicine, Bachelor of Laws, BSc Civil Engineering, etc.\n     - **National University of Science and Technology (NUST)**: BSc Electronic Engineering, BSc Applied Physics, BCom Actuarial Science, etc.\n     - **Midlands State University (MSU)**: BSc Telecommunications, BSc Human Resource Management, Bachelor of Commerce in Accounting, etc.\n     - **Zimbabwe Open University (ZOU)**:\n       - IT degrees formatted as requested: `ITM 190020`, `ITM 200021`, `ITM 210022`, `ITM 220023`, `ITM 230024`.\n       - Post Graduate Diploma in Education (PGDE) degrees formatted as requested (where first 2 digits represent the year): `EH250001`, `EH240002`, `EH230003`, `EH220004`, `EH210005`.\n     - **Chinhoyi University of Technology (CUT)**\n     - **Bindura University of Science Education (BUSE)**\n     - **Great Zimbabwe University (GZU)**\n     - **Harare Institute of Technology (HIT)**\n   - All 83 records are cryptographically signed and mined onto the simulated blockchain ledger (Blocks #1 through #83).\n   - Lookups work seamlessly across **Certificate Numbers**, **Cryptographic SHA-256 Hashes**, and **Student IDs** (e.g. `ITM 190020` or `EH250001`).\n\n2. **Form & Textbox Styling Overhaul**:\n   - **Full-Width & Responsive Inputs**: Set all `.input-control` fields to `width: 100% !important`, a modern 48px height, 12px border radius, and crisp focus rings (`#4f46e5` indigo with a soft glow) to fix the previously squished/cut-off appearance.\n   - **Modern Input Wrappers & Icons**: Added `.input-wrapper` containers with embedded SVG icons (user avatar, padlock, search magnifying glass) with padded left/right margins.\n   - **Browser Autofill Reset**: Prevented yellow/blue background overrides in WebKit/Blink browsers with an internal `-webkit-autofill` box-shadow lock.\n   - **Interactive Password Visibility Toggle**: Users can click the eye icon inside the password field to toggle between clear text and masked password.\n   - **Interactive Demo Accounts Matrix**: Added a 2x2 clickable grid for `admin`, `officer_zou`, `verifier`, and `officer` that auto-fills credentials into the inputs with visual feedback.\n   - **Professional Enterprise Branding**: Added a frosted-glass header, badge icons, subtle card shadows, and blockchain/AI trust pills.\n\nYou can view the updated portal in your browser at:\n👉 **`http://localhost:8080/login`**"}
