{"step_index":324,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:44:01Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T21:44:01+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T21:44:01+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/java/com/devops/qvs/service/AiFraudDetectionService.java`\nTotal Lines: 308\nTotal Bytes: 17063\nShowing lines 1 to 200\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: package com.devops.qvs.service;\n2: \n3: import com.devops.qvs.dto.AiAnalysisResultDto;\n4: import com.devops.qvs.dto.AiChatRequest;\n5: import com.devops.qvs.dto.AiChatResponse;\n6: import com.devops.qvs.model.Qualification;\n7: import com.devops.qvs.model.QualificationStatus;\n8: import com.devops.qvs.repository.QualificationRepository;\n9: import lombok.RequiredArgsConstructor;\n10: import lombok.extern.slf4j.Slf4j;\n11: import org.springframework.stereotype.Service;\n12: \n13: import java.time.LocalDate;\n14: import java.time.LocalDateTime;\n15: import java.util.ArrayList;\n16: import java.util.List;\n17: import java.util.Optional;\n18: \n19: @Service\n20: @RequiredArgsConstructor\n21: @Slf4j\n22: public class AiFraudDetectionService {\n23: \n24:     private final QualificationRepository qualificationRepository;\n25:     private final CryptoHashService cryptoHashService;\n26: \n27:     /**\n28:      * Executes multi-vector AI heuristic fraud and anomaly analysis on a certificate.\n29:      */\n30:     public AiAnalysisResultDto analyzeCertificate(String certificateNumber) {\n31:         log.info(\"Agentic AI Fraud Detection initiated for certificate: {}\", certificateNumber);\n32:         Optional<Qualification> qualOpt = qualificationRepository.findByCertificateNumber(certificateNumber.trim());\n33: \n34